  - governance
  - remediation
abstract: >-
  A two-volume due-diligence and remediation mandate for software written,
  configured and tested end-to-end by AI agents and maintained without human
  code review. 119 checks across product integrity, platform and runtime, and
  security, privacy and assurance — each closing on a permanent, machine-executed
  standing control rather than on human review.
